{"title":"1999 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A complete cycle of a traffic light takes 60 seconds. During each cycle the light is green for 25 seconds, yellow for 5 seconds, and red for 30 seconds. At a randomly chosen time, what is the probability that the light will NOT be green?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/a/f2a972f932737a51b982a2613761e1dd6f32a4b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{4} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{3} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\frac{5}{12} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\frac{1}{2} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\frac{7}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"367\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/9/cd9d03f32bfb35e21abb172a8727c5ecfb98f865.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\text{time not green}}{\\text{total time}} = \\frac{R + Y}{R + Y + G} = \\frac{35}{60} = \\boxed{\\text{(E)}\\ \\frac{7}{12}}\\]\" width=\"358\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The probability of green is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/0/be0c13c9b3f42f87cd8f9762606fdcc1a82299ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{25}{60} = \\frac{5}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"67\" height=\"38\" />, \nso the probability of not green is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/8/6883e8c769361564d42639e478d44ee8d31cb274.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-  \\frac{5}{12} = \\boxed{\\text{(E)}\\ \\frac{7}{12}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"141\" height=\"48\" />\n.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8\" title=\"1999 AMC 8\">1999 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"1999 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"1999 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1999\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1999 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1999 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1999 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1999 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1999 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4